## Setup
[Install buck2](https://buck2.build/docs/about/getting_started/#installing-buck2)
e.g. download the binary then
    unzstd buck2-*
    mv buck2-* /usr/local/bin/buck2

[Install gtest](https://github.com/google/googletest/releases) e.g.
    cmake .
    make
    sudo make install

Run tests
    buck2 test ...
